 Steeles Ave\, turn left at the traffic light at Hornby Rd into the area th
 at is under construction. Follow around to the lower parking area at the b
 all diamond. See the picture below. On the drive to Hornby Park\, there is
  a Tim Hortons at the PetroCanada gas station on the north-west corner of 
 Trafalgar Rd and Steeles Ave. Farther along on Steeles\, at the traffic li
 ght where you turn onto Hornby Rd\, the Esso gas station has a Hasty Mart.
