 stly shaded\, packed surface easy to ride on. On this ride\, we'll park in
  Inglewood\, go south toward Terra Cotta to the trailhead with the Mile 0 
 marker\, then retrace to Inglewood and continue north to Palgrave for lunc
 h at the Caledon Hills Brewing Company. After lunch we return to Inglewood
 . This route features a mixture of stretches on the Trailway combined with
  stretches on intersecting roads for variety. Mile 0 marker on the Caledon
  Trailway Path Caledon Hills Brewing Company Since this is planned as an a
 dvanced Urban Roller-level ride as well as a Tourist-level ride\, expect t
 he average group speed to be in the range of 21 kph....
